config BR2_PACKAGE_LVGL
	bool "lvgl"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_LIBDRM
	help
	  Light and Versatile Graphics Library, built for a Linux DRM
	  display as a static library staged for other packages to link
	  against. Carries the widgets, the DRM backend and the evdev
	  input.

	  Nothing is installed on the target: the library exists so
	  ucode-mod-lvgl can link it into lv.so.

	  https://lvgl.io/
